  "lore": {
    "mentions": {
      "v": [
        {
          "text": "A toy soldier embodying the *banality of evil* can self-knowingly enact routine cruelty as an institutionally produced role. In an off-duty scene, he might also show warmth, humour or loyalty; that tension must **increase**, not erase, the player's ability to see that others were hurt. Compassion for the performer does not automatically absolve the action. Victims and other Residents retain independent perspectives, refusal rights, consequence and memory. There is no required redemptive moral en",
          "file": "KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md",
          "line": 104,
          "heading": "C. Self-awareness is not rehabilitation, nor absolution"
        },
        {
          "text": "### F. Small scenic test concept: Orc vs toy soldier, then after hours",
          "file": "KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md",
          "line": 126,
          "heading": "F. Small scenic test concept: Orc vs toy soldier, then after hours"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Beat 1, public:** the source-true Orc mob re-enacts a losing skirmish in front of a Card/billboard; a toy soldier conscientiously applies a stupid order. Lighting and set may be exaggerated, but physical consequences/other actors still matter.",
          "file": "KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md",
          "line": 127,
          "heading": "F. Small scenic test concept: Orc vs toy soldier, then after hours"
        },
        {
          "text": "- The Toy Soldier or bureaucratic gatekeeper may sincerely perform power and become a compelling foil; no instant cozy makeover, no claim that coercion has no victims.",
          "file": "KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md",
          "line": 159,
          "heading": "2. A mutual invitation, not forced friendliness or obedience"
        }
      ],
      "src": "KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md:104; KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md:126; KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md:127; KFB_HUB/30_DECISIONS/replies/WS0_GLOBAL_INTENT_ROLE_CONSCIOUS_RESIDENTS_R1_2026-10-15.md:159",
      "status": "PREFILL"
    }
  },
